# Scratch API responses left in the repo root by an agent session — nr.json is
# an ArcGIS municipality query result from the #298 work. Nothing reads them.
# Ignored because several sessions share this checkout: the file turned up
# staged once already, and a `git add -A` from any of them would commit it.
nr.json
# data/ holds runtime artifacts (backfill snapshots, call ledgers) that must
# never be committed — but the two importer-generated REFERENCE files below
# are reviewed, small, and deploy with the code: the QoL card reads them.
# Regenerate via utils/import_ine_data.py and utils/import_cnh_hospitals.py.
# `data/*` rather than `data/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# *directory* is excluded, so the bare-directory form made the negations
# silently dead.
data/*
!data/ine_municipal.json
!data/hospitals_cnh.json
!data/sepe_unemployment.json
instance/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

